  "reasoning": "The defendant participated in two distinct criminal acts. First, he and accomplices used a knife and steel pipe to smash a victim's car, causing property damage valued at 6,483 yuan, which meets the elements of the crime of intentional destruction of property (故意毁坏财物). Second, he and an accomplice used violence and threats (beating and brandishing scissors) to forcibly take a mobile phone from the victim, then sold it, which satisfies the elements of robbery (抢劫). Both crimes are supported by the evidence and the court rejected the defense’s attempt to recharacterize the robbery as a lesser offense. Therefore, the appropriate charges are intentional destruction of property and robbery.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]故意毁坏财物;抢劫<eoa>"
